    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Packed IEEE binary16 query tiles for the BLAS exhaustive-search kernels.</para>
<para>Queries are widened in chunks of whole tiles (at most chunk_bytes of fp32, at least one tile) into a buffer reused across chunks: the fp32 copy stays bounded and each widened tile serves all database tiles. Norms are computed from the widened rows, so results match the fp32 kernels on the widened queries. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
